Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.27,0:02:51.48,OP,,0,0,0,,Preparado?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:52.14,OP,,0,0,0,,Vamos lá!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.14,0:02:53.73,OP,,0,0,0,,Não esqueceu nada?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.73,0:02:55.06,OP,,0,0,0,,Tudo pronto!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.06,0:02:56.19,OP,,0,0,0,,Mal posso esperar.
Comment: 0,0:02:56.19,0:02:57.98,OP Beach 0,,0,0,0,karaoke,Sob o céu azul,
Comment: 0,0:02:57.98,0:02:59.36,OP Beach 0,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\an3}(Essa palpitação)
Comment: 0,0:02:59.36,0:03:01.07,OP Beach 0,,0,0,0,karaoke,diante do mar azul.
Comment: 0,0:03:01.07,0:03:02.74,OP Beach 0,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\an3}(não tem fim)
Comment: 0,0:03:02.74,0:03:05.53,OP Beach 0,,0,0,0,karaoke,Vamos criar juntas
Comment: 0,0:03:05.53,0:03:12.21,OP Beach 0,,0,0,0,karaoke,lembranças inesquecíveis.
Comment: 0,0:03:15.00,0:03:21.55,OP Balloon,,0,0,0,karaoke,Procurando uma desculpa para nos reunirmos
Comment: 0,0:03:21.55,0:03:26.26,OP Balloon,,0,0,0,karaoke,e dividirmos esses sentimentos alegres
Comment: 0,0:03:26.26,0:03:27.39,OP Balloon,,0,0,0,karaoke,por cinco!
Comment: 0,0:03:27.39,0:03:30.60,OP Balloon,,0,0,0,karaoke,Nós continuamos as mesmas
Comment: 0,0:03:30.60,0:03:34.35,OP Balloon,,0,0,0,karaoke,aonde quer que estejamos,
