Comment: 0,0:21:20.92,0:21:29.02,ED,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\-black\k1}Quando o sol nasceu e a luz banhou a manhã
Comment: 0,0:21:29.02,0:21:36.57,ED,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\-black\k1}senti que algo estava prestes a acontecer.
Comment: 0,0:21:37.11,0:21:45.19,ED,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\-black\k1}Preciso abrir essa porta e deixar você saber.
Comment: 0,0:21:45.19,0:21:51.93,ED,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\-black\k1}Seria um desperdício manter isso só pra mim.
Comment: 0,0:21:53.15,0:22:04.40,ED,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\-white\k1}Um, dois, três...
Comment: 0,0:22:04.40,0:22:08.93,ED,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\-white\k1}Se dividirmos...
Comment: 0,0:22:09.52,0:22:16.61,ED,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\-white\k1}Quatro, cinco...
Comment: 0,0:22:16.61,0:22:24.11,ED,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\-white\k1}Os sonhos vão se expandir.
Comment: 0,0:22:24.54,0:22:32.69,ED,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\-white\k1}Sorria, sorria, e, quando perceber,
Comment: 0,0:22:32.69,0:22:40.79,ED,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\-white\k1}aqueles que importam estarão ao seu lado.
Comment: 0,0:22:40.79,0:22:48.97,ED,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\-white\k1}Sorria, sorria, e esses sentimentos comoventes
Comment: 0,0:22:48.97,0:22:56.93,ED,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\-white\k1}vão pintar memórias
Comment: 0,0:22:56.93,0:23:01.28,ED,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\-white\k1}neste novo dia.
